abstract: 'Four complete Lean proofs for the two-supplier random-capacity expected-profit model: lattice
  submodularity, global optimal-order existence with necessary stationarity, the exact CDF derivative
  formula, and optimized-value monotonicity in supplier reliability. Includes full-type and axiom audits,
  pinned reproduction and five rejecting controls. This substantive successor preserves the earlier two-proof
  edition. Original mathematical and platform contributors are credited; substantial Codex assistance
  is disclosed. Mathematical novelty and independent human peer review are not claimed.'
